ms/Problem_14\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b>\n</td></tr></